* ============================================================
* DC sweep with the POINTS distributed across MPI ranks
* (`.OPTIONS SWEEPPAR`): each rank owns a contiguous block of the grid and
* runs its own continuation chain; results are exchanged per point.
* Diode clipper from the Xyce Users' Guide, 26 points.
* ============================================================

.MODEL DMOD D (IS=1e-14 N=1.2 RS=0.5 CJO=0 VJ=0.7 BV=20)

VIN in 0 DC 0
R1  in out 1k
D1  out 0 DMOD

.DC VIN -10 15 1

.OPTIONS SWEEPPAR MAXITERS=250 RETRY=4

.END